BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Testament of Ann Lee
DTSTART:20260118T203000Z
DTEND:20260118T230500Z
DTSTAMP:20260118T203000Z
UID:KfI3LDXgxN
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 137 mins (2h17m)\n\nA bold colonial-era musical from
  the co-writer of The Brutalist\, Amanda Seyfried stars as visionary Shake
 r leader Ann Lee who builds a radical utopian faith in 18th century Americ
 a.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-testament-of-ann-lee\n\n
 Estimated start: 12:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
